==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 10

==Battleground==
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*3 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Lucky Sloth]] spawns as the boss after 0.4 seconds<sup>12f</sup>.

