==Strategy==
The main gist of this stage is to use the Metal Hippoe as a stepping stone for [[Long Distance]] attackers or [[:Category:Waver-class Cats|Wavers]] to chip Lucky Sloth down, eliminate Metal Hippoe, and destroy the base before the Rain D.s spawn. Some good snipers for this stage include [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]], [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]], and (for later game players) [[Ancient Egg: N005 (Special Cat)|Hitman Cat]]. The rest of your lineup should comprise of a good critter ([[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Catasaurus]] or [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Soba Cat]] work especially well), and strong rushers like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. Overall, a very simple Gauntlet.

